%
(TCPC work-config servo tuning: linear current-limit path)
(No probing. No TCPC/TWP entry. Operator must confirm safe linear clearance.)

G21 G17 G40 G54 G64 P0.001 G80 G90 G94

o<preview_guard> if [#<_task> EQ 0]
  (DEBUG, TCPC_SERVO_TUNE_LINEAR_LIMIT preview only)
  M2
o<preview_guard> endif

o<tcpc_off_check> if [#<_hal[headheadtwp.tcpc_enabled]> GT 0.5]
  (abort, TCPC servo tune linear limit requires TCPC off)
o<tcpc_off_check> endif
o<twp_off_check> if [#<_hal[headheadtwp.motion_enabled]> GT 0.5]
  (abort, TCPC servo tune linear limit requires TWP off)
o<twp_off_check> endif

(Current TCPC config limits X/Y/Z to 150 mm/s, 300 mm/s^2.)
(F9000 reaches the current 150 mm/s linear limit; F12000 should be clamped.)
(MSG, Confirm safe clearance for +/-120 mm X/Y and +/-50 mm Z relative moves)
M0

G91
F9000
G1 X120
G1 X-120
G1 Y120
G1 Y-120
G1 Z50
G1 Z-50

F12000
G1 X120
G1 X-120
G1 Y120
G1 Y-120
G1 Z50
G1 Z-50

G90
(DEBUG, TCPC_SERVO_TUNE_LINEAR_LIMIT complete)
M30
